(iii) receive and display notifications or information without the capability to respond; or
(iv) track the individual's physical location.


(2) (a) An LEA:(i) shall establish a policy that allows a student to use a cellphone, smart watch, or emerging technology:(A) to respond to an imminent threat to the health or safety of an individual;
